    "identifier": "earth-release-rock-tank",
    "description": "<p>The user covers itself with earth, soil or sand and molds it into a rolling sphere that is then launched at a target in range, crushing them beneath its new weight. Make a melee ninjutsu attack against a creature you can see within range propelling yourself towards the target creature and ending your movement occupying the targets space, if possible, dealing 4d8 Earth damage. The target also makes a Strength saving throw being knocked Prone.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8.</p>",
